      "created_at": "2014-02-10T15:07:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was playing a game yesterday with my brorher's new Room City cards and we wound up fighting Plauge Rat in Pike Industrial Complex, I have a question should a card called \"unstable mutagen\" or something like that which brings rat monsters out of the trash, and buffs their damage and defense also buff Plauge Rats damage and make him harder to hurt?</p><p>Him being a rat is right in his a name, but his description is only \"villain\" as opposed to Dawn who if memory serves actually has \"Villain, citizen\" in hers.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It probably would not have effected the outcome of the cane, but I would like to hear your guys thoughts on the matter...</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:17.220Z",
